# DESK18 -- the STDEFDIR alert. Same double-click on C:\HELLO.TXT as the
# association runs, but the seeded `#G` line points its application at
# `D:\NOSUCH\APP.NCP`: `set_default_path("D:\NOSUCH\")` reaches `Dsetpath`,
# which cannot mount D: and answers EPTHNF
# (`docs/api/gemdos/directory/3b-dsetpath.md`). `do_aopen` then raises
# `STDEFDIR` and does NOT launch (`desksupp.c:911-915`) -- note the order:
# the directory is set BEFORE the `file_exists(pa->a_pappl)` check, so this is
# the "failed to set default directory" alert and not "file not found".
100 parkbr
300 move 600 460
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 435 260
1800 down
1803 up
1808 down
1811 up
3000 mark B_ALERT
